# ASCIIwire DSL v3 Sample - Dashboard UI
@vstack
  @header
    Dashboard

  @hstack height=fill
    @vstack width=30%
      @nav
        [ Home ] [ Users ] [ Settings ] [ Reports ]

      @panel height=fill
        Menu Footer
        v1.0.0

    @vstack width=fill
      @panel height=5
        Welcome back, Admin
        Last login: 2026-06-30

      @hstack height=8
        @panel width=50%
          Statistics
          Users: 1,234
          Active: 567
          Revenue: $12k

        @panel width=50%
          Recent Activity
          - User login
          - File upload
          - Comment posted

      @table
        | ID | User    | Role   | Status |
        |----|---------|--------|--------|
        | 1  | Alice   | Admin  | Active |
        | 2  | Bob     | Editor | Idle   |
        | 3  | Charlie | Viewer | Away   |

  @footer
    v1.0.0 | (c) 2024 ASCIIwire
